=2 Walkthrough
!Toraimarai Composite.png|right|Toraimarai Composite map
In order to receive the cutscene from the **Moon Spiral** in {p:Full Moon Fountain}, you have to have at least 1 sap Key Item in your possession:
* The 8 elemental saps can be found at various locations throughout {z:Toraimarai Canal} and have the effect of weakening the Astral Flow ability of the corresponding Fomor's avatar in the battlefield awaiting you in the next mission.
** At max level, it is possible to skip most of the mission by warping to {p:Home Point} #1, getting the {@k} {k:Dark sap crystal} near the Home Point, then backtracking to {p:Full Moon Fountain} to continue the questline.
** If you're attempting the upcoming battle below level 99, collecting all the saps will make the fight easier.
* The elemental saps appear as glowing **???**s at the following locations:
** {@k} {k:Dark sap crystal}: (F-8) Map 1
** {@k} {k:Earth sap crystal}: (J-8) or (H-7) Map 1
** {@k} {k:Water sap crystal}: (H-7) or (J-9) Map 1
** {@k} {k:Fire sap crystal}: (J-9) Map 1; (F-10) or (J-8) Map 2
** {@k} {k:Ice sap crystal}: (I-8) or (H-7) Map 2
** {@k} {k:Light sap crystal}: (G-8) Map 2 (one of two places)
** {@k} {k:Lightning sap crystal}: (H-7) Map 1; (G-10/11) Map 2
** {@k} {k:Wind sap crystal}: (H-9) or (J-9) Map 2
* Once one or more saps are collected, check the **Moon Spiral** in {p:Full Moon Fountain} to watch the cutscene and complete the mission.

